{"id":"1b063a495af93bce","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-cor-iterated-ult.md","title":"Iterated Ultrapower Corollary","display":"cor-iterated-ult — Iterated Ultrapower Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-iterated-ult","aliases":["58-cor-iterated-ult"],"display":"cor-iterated-ult — Iterated Ultrapower Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-iterated-ult"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-iterated-ult</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-iterated-ult — Iterated Ultrapower Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md\">../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b22660cd0ce1252a\" href=\"?note=b22660cd0ce1252a\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1689492fab8da0e1\" href=\"?note=1689492fab8da0e1\" title=\"58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md\">58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (measurable cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"109d01fe15884218\" href=\"?note=109d01fe15884218\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md\">../batch10/58-df-measurable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\)</span> is the set-coded normal-measure predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,U)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M,U}\">\\(j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M,U}\\)</span>、类结构恒等映射及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 按 <code>58-df-class-measure-ultrapower</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_n=(A_n,\\in)\">\\(M_n=(A_n,\\in)\\)</span> 是元语言结构；类序列中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_n\">\\(A_n\\)</span> 为其载体。偏算子等式只在该文件规定的定义域内读取。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\">\\(\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\)</span> quantifies over a metatheoretic sequence of class models and class maps, not over a set in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ult}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\;\\Bigl[\nM_0=(V,\\in)\n\\land U_0=U\n\\land j_{0,0}=\\operatorname{id}_V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nU_n=j_{0,n}(U)\n\\land M_{n+1}=\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M_n,U_n)\n\\land j_{n,n+1}=j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M_n,U_n}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,n}:M_m\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}M_n\n\\land j_{m,m}=\\operatorname{id}_{M_m}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n\\leq\\ell&lt;\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,\\ell}=j_{n,\\ell}\\circ j_{m,n}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ult}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\rangle\\;\\Bigl[\nM_0=(V,\\in)\n\\land U_0=U\n\\land j_{0,0}=\\operatorname{id}_V\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nU_n=j_{0,n}(U)\n\\land M_{n+1}=\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M_n,U_n)\n\\land j_{n,n+1}=j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M_n,U_n}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n&lt;\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,n}:M_m\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}M_n\n\\land j_{m,m}=\\operatorname{id}_{M_m}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n\\leq\\ell&lt;\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,\\ell}=j_{n,\\ell}\\circ j_{m,n}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The stages <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_n\">\\(M_n\\)</span> and maps <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_{m,n}\">\\(j_{m,n}\\)</span> are proper classes, so their omega-indexed family is explicitly metatheoretic rather than falsely quantified as a set.</li>\n<li>The displayed data include every transition map and its coherence; this is the finite-stage part of the omega iteration. The direct limit at stage <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> remains separate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"b22660cd0ce1252a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md","status":"resolved","id":"1689492fab8da0e1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-class-measure-ultrapower.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-measurable.md","status":"resolved","id":"109d01fe15884218","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)$ (measurable cardinal, see [[../batch10/58-df-measurable.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,U)","display":false},{"tex":"j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M,U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"M_n=(A_n,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"A_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n<\\omega\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}iterated\\text{-}ult}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(U,\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\langle M_n,U_n,j_{m,n}:m\\leq n<\\omega\\rangle\\;\\Bigl[\nM_0=(V,\\in)\n\\land U_0=U\n\\land j_{0,0}=\\operatorname{id}_V\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nU_n=j_{0,n}(U)\n\\land M_{n+1}=\\operatorname{Ult}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M_n,U_n)\n\\land j_{n,n+1}=j^{\\mathrm{ult}}_{M_n,U_n}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n<\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,n}:M_m\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{meta}}M_n\n\\land j_{m,m}=\\operatorname{id}_{M_m}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall m\\leq n\\leq\\ell<\\omega\\;\\bigl(\nj_{m,\\ell}=j_{n,\\ell}\\circ j_{m,n}\\bigr)\n\\Bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M_n","display":false},{"tex":"j_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2209,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-cor-iterated-ult.md|58-cor-iterated-ult]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["80d22bbd3f726e33","109d01fe15884218","b22660cd0ce1252a","1689492fab8da0e1"]}